### Step 4 — Confirm

- Show completed doc; ask for corrections.
- Tell user: other marketing rules will read this automatically; re-run when positioning or ICP shifts materially.

---

## Tips **[core]**

- Ask "What's the #1 frustration that brings them to you?" not "What problem do you solve?"
- Capture examples: "Can you quote how a customer described this?"
- Validate each section before moving on when interviewing from scratch.

---

## What this rule does not cover

| Need | Use instead |
|------|-------------|
| Deep launch/revamp positioning workshop | `brand-strategy.mdc` |
| Write homepage or landing copy | `marketing-copy.mdc` |
| SEO audit or page optimization | `seo-audit.mdc`, `on-page-seo.mdc` |

## Related rules

- After context exists → `brand-strategy.mdc`, `marketing-copy.mdc`, `programmatic-seo.mdc`, `seo-audit.mdc` (all read context first)
